Z||000033||Sage||09-28-2001||11:41 PM||||Rodney;<P>That just plain "sucks"!  I think the only thing I ever got from them was a T-shirt, but I will have a hard time justifying ever ordering anything else from them.  If they want to stock the parts YOU came up with and make, why don't they get them from you?  That's just waaaay below the belt.  Do you think Smitty's message was some kind of request for permission????  Guess not since they already did it!  Just consider me part of the boycott!  Hard to have a good one after this.  Just tell yourself imitation is the sincerest form of flattery!   No??? don't blame you...that just plain sucks!<P>That is just   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_bs.gif">!!!||||reg||13
